WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.002
Your policy deck already holds your compliance training.

2
00:00:04.052 --> 00:00:08.787
Here's how to turn it into a clear narrated video, without a studio or voice talent.

3
00:00:09.787 --> 00:00:14.115
Start from the approved policy, then strip out the background and history.

4
00:00:14.165 --> 00:00:17.925
Staff mainly need the rule, why it matters, and what to do.

5
00:00:19.187 --> 00:00:21.484
Rewrite every headline as an instruction.

6
00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:27.685
'Gifts and hospitality' becomes: declare any gift over the policy limit within five working days.

7
00:00:29.185 --> 00:00:34.222
Your speaker notes become the narration, so write them like you'd explain the rule to a colleague.

8
00:00:34.272 --> 00:00:38.716
Then add a scenario, like Priya and the supplier hamper, so it sticks.

9
00:00:39.716 --> 00:00:45.832
Turn captions on and check contrast, at least 4.5 to 1, so everyone can follow.

10
00:00:45.882 --> 00:00:50.118
When a threshold changes, edit the slide and note, export again.

11
00:00:51.118 --> 00:00:54.912
Try Basic first, with narration, captions and transitions.

12
00:00:54.962 --> 00:00:58.861
On Pro, a.i. directs your video, one clear scene per rule.

13
00:00:58.911 --> 00:01:01.266
Start at powerpoint2vid.com.

